  "full_text": "Today I was able to pay my whole team with a single click. Could have been none but the scheduler service failed. This little tool really shows how much ecosystem evolved that  we can solve simple real world problems today by connecting multiple contracts. https://t.co/Dok5gmOJor",
  "lang": "en",
